@startuml View List of Class by Admin
actor Admin
participant ": ClassManagementPage " as ClassManagementPage
participant ": Router " as Router
participant ": ClassGroupController " as ClassGroupController
participant ": ClassGroupService " as ClassGroupService
participant ": ClassGroupRepository " as ClassGroupRepository
database Database

Admin->ClassManagementPage: 1. Navigate to Class Management page
activate Admin
activate ClassManagementPage

ClassManagementPage->Router: 2. Send GET /api/classgroup/dashboard?academicYearId={id}
activate Router
deactivate ClassManagementPage

Router->ClassGroupController: 3. Route Request to Controller
activate ClassGroupController
deactivate Router

ClassGroupController->ClassGroupService: 4. GetDashboardDataAsync(academicYearId)
activate ClassGroupService
deactivate ClassGroupController

ClassGroupService->ClassGroupRepository: 5. GetAllAsync() - Get all classes
activate ClassGroupRepository
ClassGroupRepository->Database: 6. Query ClassGroups with AcademicYear and Members
activate Database
Database-->ClassGroupRepository: 7. Return ClassGroups with relations
deactivate Database
ClassGroupRepository-->ClassGroupService: 8. Return classes list
deactivate ClassGroupRepository

ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 9. Filter by AcademicYearId (if provided)
ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 10. Calculate Statistics (TotalClasses, TotalStudents, TotalTeachers)
ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 11. Group Classes by Grade
ClassGroupService->ClassGroupService: 12. Map Entities to DTOs
ClassGroupService-->ClassGroupController: 13. Return ClassGroupDashboardDto
deactivate ClassGroupService
activate ClassGroupController

ClassGroupController->ClassGroupController: 14. Wrap in ResponseDto
ClassGroupController-->Router: 15. Send Success Response
activate Router
deactivate ClassGroupController

Router-->ClassManagementPage: 16. Return Dashboard Data
activate ClassManagementPage
deactivate Router

ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 17. Extract classes from dashboard data
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 18. Update classes state
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 19. Update dashboardStats state
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 20. Group classes by grade
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 21. Load homeroom teachers
ClassManagementPage->ClassManagementPage: 22. Render component
ClassManagementPage-->Admin: 23. Display List of Classes
deactivate ClassManagementPage
deactivate Admin
@enduml

